  "solution": {
    "text": "Acidic nature of sulphonic acid is more than that of carboxylic acid and carboxylic acid is more acidic then an alcohol.<br />Acidic nature <math><mo>∝</mo></math> electron withdrawing group <math> <mrow>  <mo>&#x221D;</mo><mfrac>   <mtext>1</mtext>   <mrow>    <mtext>electron</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>releasing</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>group</mtext></mrow>  </mfrac>  </mrow></math>.<br />Here the correct order of acidic nature is III &lt; V &lt; IV &lt; II &lt; I.",
